Ability:
{up50}Whenever one or more of the following occurs for the first time after ~ enters the battlefield, put a bingo counter on ~:
• {indent}A card is put into a player’s hand outside draw step.{/indent}
• {indent}A spell or ability destroys a permanent.{/indent}
• {indent}A spell with mana value 6 or greater is cast.{/indent}
• {indent}A card is put into exile.{/indent}
When ~ has four or more bingo counters on it, draw seven cards, then exile ~
